{%- comment -%} Days, hours, minutes and seconds left (filled in by the server, then ticked by the runtime). Param: date (datetime setting) {%- endcomment -%}
<span class="shop-cd__unit"><b data-unit="d">{{ date.remaining.d }}</b><small>dni</small></span><span class="shop-cd__sep" aria-hidden="true">:</span><span class="shop-cd__unit"><b data-unit="h">{{ date.remaining.h }}</b><small>godz.</small></span><span class="shop-cd__sep" aria-hidden="true">:</span><span class="shop-cd__unit"><b data-unit="m">{{ date.remaining.m }}</b><small>min</small></span><span class="shop-cd__sep" aria-hidden="true">:</span><span class="shop-cd__unit"><b data-unit="s">{{ date.remaining.s }}</b><small>sek.</small></span>
